## 4. Rules (always obey)

- `investment-core.mdc` — disclaimer + goal honesty
- `trade-safety.mdc` — manual Wealthsimple execution; paper trading gates
- `garp-scoring.mdc` — min score 60, swap delta 15, position limits 20%/40%

## 5. Trade output format (required)

Every buy/sell proposal:

```
Action | Ticker | Shares | CAD Amount | Buy Price | GARP Score | Rationale | Risk | Today bias
```

Save memos to `research/reports/YYYY-MM-DD-{topic}.md`. After user confirms fills, update `portfolio/holdings.yaml`.

## 6. Hooks (do not bypass)

Hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json` enforce safety automatically. Do not circumvent drawdown, paper trading, rate limits, or secret blocking. A hook deny is final.

Penny universes: `portfolio/penny9-universe.yaml` (primary) and `portfolio/penny-secondary-watchlist.yaml` (20 names, all `watch` — never auto-buy). Daily scan: `scripts/scoring/daily-penny9-scan.py`. If Rebalance-MCP is down, do not promote a name to Buy.

## 7. End every session

- Include the **disclaimer** (not licensed financial advice)
- Note paper trading / drawdown status
- Save report if analysis was performed
- Suggest one concrete next action (trade ticket, module lesson, or portfolio update)

## Execution mode

**Manual only:** User executes in Wealthsimple TFSA app. Do not require wsli. Update YAML after fills.
